text = "\"Creating a horror monster is a always thankless losing battle. This is because the moment you draw a single pixel, or sculpted a single object, you have already lost. You have sacrificed the endless unknown for a limited tangible model. And no matter how good your CGI or art style is it can never beed the infinite imagination of your audience.\"

- Jason Le, 2024

\"Yeah I couln't find someone who said this kinda quote
but it is a very common sentiment so I think it still works.\"

- Jason Le, 2024 Again"
